## Scope and acceptance criteria
Replace thick horizontal rules between every CLI entry with rules between contextually appropriate row groups. Group using similarity, spatial distance/clustering etc; show changes in a region together. Grouping appropriate to table kind.

## State at ingestion
Outstanding work; not implemented by this ingestion.

## Source dependencies
