Decision and sequencing: Presentation lane after B037 closes. Decision: group embedded rows by change kind and path context; spatial rows by deterministic physical proximity while keeping coordinate ties together; separators only at group boundaries, not each entry. Cover distant/near/identical coordinate cases.

Independent review found dense spatial grouping quadratic: 16k 1.08s, 32k 3.79s, 64k 15.8s. Keep ticket open; fix deterministic connected grouping to avoid all pairs inside dense components and add operation-count/performance regression plus cross-cell bridge correctness tests.